# KPI anti-regression

Do not declare Done or Green on KPI-02 without a JaCoCo/Istanbul/Vitest report path.
Do not declare Green on KPI-03 if in-scope stories lack a traceability matrix.
Do not declare Green on dependency health with unwaived high/critical CVEs.
0 unwaived high CVEs when this rule is in scope.
